  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SAKs projekt f&#xf6;r utbildning, m&#xf6;drav&#xe5;rd, hiv/aids och m&#xe4;nniskor med funktionshinder. Projektet bidrar till att byskolor, flickskolor, modellskolor, barnmorskeutbildning, ortopediska kliniker samt skolor och inkomstgenererande verksamhet f&#xf6;r funktionshindrade. Projektet har fokus p&#xe5; de fyra norra provinserna d&#xe4;r det svenska PRT opererar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCA&apos;s project for education, Mother and Child Health, HIV/AIDS awareness and People with Disabilities. The project contributes to community based schools, girls schools, model schools, midwifery training, orthopaedic clinics as well as schools and income  generating activities for disabled people. The project has a focus on the four northern provinces where the Swedish PRT operates.</narrative>
  </description>
